<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seaweed, wrack,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄστρεια . . φῦκος ἠμφιεσμένα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				110.2
			</span></i>; differing from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύον</span> in
			size, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				603a17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.6.2
			</span></i>: 
				Ep.
			 dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύκεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					6
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. θαλάσσιον οὖλον</span>”
				<i>orchella-weed, Roccella tinctoria,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.99
				</span></i>
			; called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. πόντιον</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.6.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. θ. πλατύ</span>”
				<i>peacock's tail, Padina mediterranea,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ὑπόμηκες και᾽
				ὑποφοινικίζον</span>
			<i>Nitrophyllum punctatum,</i> ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ὅμοιον τῇ ἀγρώστει</span>”
				<i>mattress grass-weed, Zostera marina,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.6.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. πλατύφυλλον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τριχόφυλλον ὥσπερ τὸ μάραθον,</span>
			<i>Cystoseira foeniculosa,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sedge</i> or <i>weed</i> growing in a lake, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				576
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>orchil,</i> prepared from 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			 and used as <i>rouge</i> by Greek women, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				320.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1390.22
			</span></i> (Andania, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυκίς</span>
			, <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
